                        "结果集合包含重复设备: " + input.deviceId());
            }
            Map<String, String> row = new LinkedHashMap<>();
            row.put("deviceId", input.deviceId());
            row.put("result", input.result().name());
            row.put("failureReason", input.result() == ReceiptResult.FAILED
